DECISIONS 195, EVALUATION.md §3.3: a where run is one frame toward the 10000 limit; a predicate
that stores its value into its own record runs itself without end, so it is E4402, never a host
stack overflow.
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// A value.
record R {
  /// V.
  v: Int where R { v: it }.v >= 0
}

/// The value.
let r: R = { v: 1 }
-- findings.txt --
error[E4402]  a/a.canon:7:16
  r: call depth exceeds 10000

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
